    "body": "# Inductive Consensus Clustering (ICC v1.0.0)\n\nInitial open-source release of the Inductive Consensus Clustering library.\n\n## Key Features\n- Linear $O(N \\cdot D)$ Bimodality-Gated Subspace Selection (BGSS) using finite-sample null-corrected Sarle's Bimodality Coefficient.\n- Rectangular $O(N \\cdot L)$ bipartite Transfer-Cut consensus solver.\n- Closed-form out-of-sample inductive projection.\n- Comparative baseline clustering implementations (K-Means, GMM, Spectral, Leiden-SNN, Hierarchical, Monti Consensus).\n- Automated test harness and verification suites.\n\n## Installation\n```bash\npip install icc==1.0.0\n```\n"
