    "body": "# ICC v2.2.0: Extended Evaluation Protocols & High-Dimensional Benchmarks\n\nRelease v2.2.0 delivers comprehensive multi-domain benchmarking tools, extended baseline fidelity suites, and performance optimizations.\n\n## Highlights\n- **Extended Benchmarks:** Full evaluation harness for classical, sparse, deep, and consensus clustering pipelines.\n- **Stability Analysis:** Automated subsampling stability evaluation and non-degeneracy audit utilities.\n- **Numerical Robustness:** Improved numerical conditioning in spectral solvers and similarity metrics.\n- **Modular Restructuring:** Clean modular layout separating algorithms, consensus, evaluation, and data pipelines.\n\n## Installation\n```bash\npip install icc==2.2.0\n```\n"
